 came across a mother duck defending her ducklings against a Coot. A Great Crested Grebe can also be seen swimming past at one point.\n</p><p>Filmed on the Canon FS200, keep in mind that I rendered this video at 1.25mb so the quality is a little degraded.\n</p><p>This is the Jubilee river at Eton going towards Windsor.\n</p><p>This was edited on OpenShot for Linux, using Inkscape for the Titles.\n</p>\nVoice was recorded on Gnome Sound Recorder for Linux Ubuntu.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2011-05-24","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<bdi lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:YouTube_files\" title=\"Commons:YouTube files\">YouTube</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGYdbdYhzCM\"><bdi lang=\"\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGYdbdYhzCM</bdi></a> \u2013 View/save archived versions on <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGYdbdYhzCM\">archive.org</a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/ZaydDepaor\">https://www.youtube.com/user/ZaydDepaor</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Attribution":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/ZaydDepaor\">https://www.youtube.com/user/ZaydDepaor</a>","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"